cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "CarSim Simulation Dataset for 'Vehicle Lateral Velocity Estimation System Embedding Time-Varying Cornering Stiffness Learning Considering Sim-to-Real Gap'"
abstract: >-
  Nine CarSim runs (100 Hz, 580 channels) used to build the simulation
  pre-training dataset of a physics-guided cornering-stiffness learning and
  Kalman-filtering lateral-velocity estimator. Channels include body
  velocities and accelerations, yaw rate, steering-wheel angle, per-wheel
  lateral forces, slip angles, vertical loads and tire-road friction.
